WEBVTT

00:11:28.236 --> 00:11:30.556
And so this question is great
because it's like,

00:11:30.596 --> 00:11:32.156
well, what can I notice?

00:11:32.196 --> 00:11:34.836
And then what do I do
with that information, right?

00:11:34.836 --> 00:11:38.036
So, like, don't just panic
and don't tell anyone.

00:11:38.076 --> 00:11:41.956
There's so much shame and stigma attached
to anything going on with the brain

00:11:41.996 --> 00:11:44.156
and particularly memory.

00:11:44.196 --> 00:11:45.716
But this becomes information

00:11:45.716 --> 00:11:48.316
that you can be in conversation
with your doctor about.

00:11:48.316 --> 00:11:50.036
So what is your cognition?

00:11:50.036 --> 00:11:51.476
What is your memory today

00:11:51.516 --> 00:11:53.516
and what does it look like
a year from now?

00:11:53.556 --> 00:11:54.716
Is it changing?

00:11:54.716 --> 00:11:56.276
And so what are the differences?

00:11:56.316 --> 00:11:58.676
So forgetting people's names,

00:11:58.716 --> 00:12:00.076
totally normal.